    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwadwa kwa Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa ikenda, mori ghwa ikumi ghwa kubonya nguma kwake Zedekia mzuri wa Juda, Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni ukacha na majeshi ghake ghose, na kughurughaia muzi ghwa Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja ikenda ja mori ghwa kana, mwaka ghwa ikumi na imweri ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Zedekia, wurigha ghwa muzi ghorechikanyiroghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerusalemu iendawadwa, wabaa wose wa mzuri wa Babuloni wikacha na kusea kidombo andenyi ya Mbenge ya Ghadi na ghadi, chiaimweri na Nergali-shareza, Samgari-nebo, Sarsekimu na Nargali-shareza umu, na wabaa wazima wose wa mzuri wa Babuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Mzuri Zedekia na masikari ghake wawiwona, wikakimbia na kufuma mzinyi nakio, wikamaria chia ya mbuwa ya mzuri, wikaidiria mbengenyi iko aghadi ya mawurigha awi, wikaghenda kulangaya Araba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ijeshi ja Wababuloni jikawinugha, wikammbwada Zedekia aho wurindinyi ghwa Jeriko, nawo wikamreda kwa Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni aho Ribla isanga ja Hamathi. Nebukadnezari ukamtanya aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawibwagha wana wa Zedekia aho Ribla, Zedekia ukizighanira; wokoni ukawibwagha wabaa wose wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaghifunya meso gha Zedekia, ukamfunga na pingu na kumdwa cha Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wababuloni wikaikora ngome ya mzuri, na nyumba ra wandu; wikaghuchikanya wurigha ghwa Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Nebuzaradani, uo m'baa wa majeshi, ukawidwa wunyika cha Babuloni awo wandu weresigharikieghe mzinyi; awo werekimbirieghe cha kwake na awo weresigharikieghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawisigha awo werekoghe wakiwa wikaie ahoeni isangenyi ja Juda, awo wiserekoghe na kindo chingi; ukawineka mbuwa ra mizabibu na mbuwa iyo ngelo cheni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kufungulwa kwa Jeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni ukafunya momu aighu yapo kwa kumlaghira Nebuzaradani uo m'baa wa majeshi ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wada Jeremia kumlindie nicha, kusem'bonye ilagho jingi, ela kum'bonyere seji ukuzeragha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Nebuzaradani, uo m'baa wa majeshi, chiaimweri na wabaa Nebushazibani na Nergali-shareza, na wabaa wose wa mzuri wa Babuloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wikaduma na kunireda kufuma waza ya walindiri; wikaniwika mikonunyi kwa Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu, wawae Shafani, eri upate kunighalisha. Kwa huwo ini Jeremia ngakaia aghadi ya wandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isuwirio kwa wundu ghwa Ebedi-meleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora nani niko kifungonyi wazenyi ya walindiri, ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghenda kumzere Ebedi-meleki Muethiopia huwu, ‘Ini BWANA wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Israeli naghamba nichakatisha malagho ghapo nereghighorieghe aighu ya ughu muzi; kwa kughubonya kiwiwi hata si kughubonyera nicha anduangi, nagho ghichakatia ituku ijo imbiri yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela oho nichakukira, hata ndekuchaangirwa mikonunyi kwa awo wandu kwawuyawiobua anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu kwa loli nichakulindia hata ndekuchaabwaghwa wudenyi, ela irangi jako jichakaia banana, angu korenirumirieghe. Ini BWANA naghamba.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.39.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
